[{"title":"仲春闻雁","author":"玄烨","text":"渐喜春和踏草行，郊原遥听曙鸡鸣。\n宾鸿欲向银湾渚，社燕方栖静舍楹。\n已觉阴消馀雪?，争看阳长早潮生。\n省耕畿辅先群吏，留憩田间夜不惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阅永定河堤","author":"玄烨","text":"豫定安澜在事前，每逢雨潦自心牵。\n帑金不惜筹耕种，膏土惟思广陌阡。\n堤老失防愁剥蚀，岸坚常护幸安全。\n肩舆频视桃花水，滚滚浑波通碧涟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"络纬养至暮春","author":"玄烨","text":"秋深厌聒耳，今得锦囊盛。\n经腊鸣香阁，逢春接玉笙。\n物微宜护惜，事渺亦均平。\n造化虽流转，安然比养生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十五年三月下旬园中桃杏玉兰梅花齐放其中玉兰茂盛可观特请皇太后一阅","author":"玄烨","text":"玉花万朵祝慈颜，藉奉欢心半日閒。\n闰月春迟添岁永，香枝风送待时还。\n膝前五代承王母，陛下千龄献寿山。\n乍晓铜龙迎凤辇，霜容天上睹仙鬟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"去岁三冬有雪至三月间农忙之际二十七日夜雨竟夕喜而成咏","author":"玄烨","text":"滋麦如酥雨，空濛入土膏。\n心同黎庶苦，目盼紫坛高。\n任器已知重，安人宁避劳。\n春愁暂且释，点点付挥毫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得陇麦","author":"玄烨","text":"节迟谷雨后，田麦始分畦。\n已送花开尽，难将春事稽。\n纯阳时序近，馀闰化成齐。\n未卜阴晴适，先期辑庶黎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十五年冬谒陵作","author":"玄烨","text":"拜奉山陵泪两垂，提携鞠育赖仁慈。\n松林转盛青如许，鬓发劳伤白所宜。\n屈指多年思慕永，深惭暮景远来迟。\n珠邱玉殿依然觐，悲想音容寸晷移。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春幸","author":"玄烨","text":"载阳节候爱春和，宾日中衡社后过。\n东作勤耕劳众力，西成有穫广农科。\n官箴先戒关河固，节钺曾经岁月多。\n正已清心倡庶吏，宣恩莫使政烦苛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风阻驻跸白洋湖偶成","author":"玄烨","text":"平波数顷似江声，风阻湖边一日程。\n可笑当年巡幸远，依稀吴越列行营。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小满后偶旱涂中祈雨四月二十三日甘霖大霈","author":"玄烨","text":"夙夜愁怀春夏间，天时难信未怡颜。\n平原晚麦纤茎槁，四野新禾旱色殷。\n乍起云光连岭岫，先垂雨脚遍人寰。\n共沾甘澍敷膏泽，民食方知稼穑艰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚夏偶成","author":"玄烨","text":"青榛方作粒，郁李渐微红。\n草药迷香径，荷花待晚风。\n莫愁秋雨近，且望岁时丰。\n倚槛频观稼，银须一老翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆扬州天宁寺竹","author":"玄烨","text":"久别金焦十一年，依稀寒暑递推迁。\n此君有意虚心待，叹我徒劳幽思牵。\n雁逐西风何处问，云回北地竟谁传。\n翠筠晚节饶苍箨，远寄宸章梵宇前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七月十六日赐九十一岁老和尚","author":"玄烨","text":"暑退全消陌上尘，盂兰大喜见姚秦。\n临风洗钵龙池雨，凝露舒莲鹫岭春。\n送节双轮同梦幻，持心半偈见深淳。\n循环已识盈虚理，不向山僧更问津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"玄烨","text":"杖藜端不染轻尘，野趣天然景物新。\n春水风帆一目尽，孰知逝者太华津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泽卜尊丹巴胡土克图老喇嘛上寿","author":"玄烨","text":"想像当年论转轮，龙沙遥隔十馀春。\n相知惟有菩提行，得解尝闻秘密真。\n花雨频施铺佛帐，贝经每祝上枫宸。\n眉横鼻竖长松寿，导引众生善后因。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"未开新荷","author":"玄烨","text":"清和将尽未端阳，时雨催擎珠点凉。\n不染淤泥看净植，虽无花气叶先香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏题千里眼","author":"玄烨","text":"欲穷视远目，旷渺有无中。\n体认全凭准，遐观约略同。\n虽依双镜力，独用一瞳功。\n不重西来巧，清明本在躬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赐松江提督赵珀","author":"玄烨","text":"忆昔云间山水邦，波流清润抵松江。\n春秋久未临銮辂，时刻尝怀拥节幢。\n训练多方娴步伐，抚循成俗重敦庞。\n建牙好慰军民望，服众投醪士气降。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绿金莲花","author":"玄烨","text":"牡丹有绿诚仙品，幻色生香野草中。\n数朵乍开凝碧玉，黄花应逊碧花丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赐老大臣","author":"玄烨","text":"旧日讲筵剩几人，徒伤老朽并君臣。\n平生壮志衰如许，诸事灰心懒逼真。\n求简逡巡多恍惚，遇烦留滞累精神。\n年来词赋荒疏久，觅句深惭笔有尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏州巡抚吴存礼","author":"玄烨","text":"曾记临吴十二年，文风人杰并堪传。\n予怀常念穷黎困，勉尔勤箴官吏贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山庄四季 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"节届三春胜，发生万汇齐。\n诸花候御辇，百谷待村犁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山庄四季 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"九夏愁旸雨，千林叶正肥。\n秪因思避暑，端拱计频违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山庄四季 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"金风多爽䬃，清露滴烟浮。\n目睹仓箱满，方知岁有秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山庄四季 其四","author":"玄烨","text":"岁暮添霜鬓，殷勤宵旰劳。\n地寒盈尺雪，还虑北风高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬至不能全礼","author":"玄烨","text":"老残多阻诣圜丘，一念精诚或解忧。\n愆过常思天每鉴，衰颓恒觉自难由。\n无心成化无私覆，不息流行不显求。\n瞻拜洪钧斩礼缺，书云颙望太平秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"千叟宴","author":"玄烨","text":"百里山川积素妍，古稀白发会琼筵。\n还须尚齿勿尊爵，且向长眉拜瑞年。\n莫讶君臣同健壮，愿偕亿兆共昌延。\n万几惟我无休暇，七十衰龄未歇肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题新安道上","author":"玄烨","text":"满目平川映远空，身形少健一衰翁。\n社前荷锸争春暖，陇畔扶犁趁晚风。\n雨泽深邀天地德，耕桑还赖穑人功。\n京南每出同村叟，总得阳和一气中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示平藏将士","author":"玄烨","text":"去年藏里凯歌回，丹陛今朝宴赏陪。\n万里辛勤瞬息过，欢声载道似春雷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六十一年春斋戒书","author":"玄烨","text":"性理参天地，经书辅国朝。\n勿劳民力尽，莫使俗氛嚣。\n不误农桑事，须轻内外徭。\n风高林鸟静，雨足路尘消。\n视察焉能隐，行藏岂可摇。\n桑榆虽景暮，松柏后霜凋。\n长养春容盛，宽严君德调。\n倦勤应不免，对越愧明昭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"园中无处无花触目皆是故作此自嘲","author":"玄烨","text":"无花无酒亦氤氲，况有清香到处闻。\n万紫千红虽瞬息，古稀吟咏忘辛勤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"端阳","author":"玄烨","text":"春夏连年旱魃灾，虽逢令节免流杯。\n清和幸得甘霖霈，竞渡蒲樽览一回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"久旱无雨夙夜徬徨夏至前方得普沾","author":"玄烨","text":"喜雨虽云快，岂无久旱由。\n望云待旦起，问夜数更愁。\n霹雳偏稽候，风霾任作尤。\n西成登谷后，方慰悯农忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避雨闻钟","author":"玄烨","text":"雨阻端阳涌翠隈，荷香瀑水点新苔。\n午钟忽送昙花曲，那得閒心笑几回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同老侍卫","author":"玄烨","text":"庞眉经岁月，忆昔旧人稀。\n少小儿童戏，年高亲故违。\n叹无手足力，偏有友朋讥。\n膝下曾孙事，怡情待晚晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佛桑花","author":"玄烨","text":"木槿层楼号佛桑，新移远道爱芬芳。\n开时先占榴花艳，留日还同菊蕊香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"京中报到霖雨普沾","author":"玄烨","text":"亢阳愁久旱，霖雨满沟渠。\n倏忽枯枝润，须臾卷叶舒。\n千村勤袯襫，万顷促犁锄。\n企望收成后，欣看谷贱书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏至","author":"玄烨","text":"山庄逢夏至，斋戒禁中同。\n翠渚萍先绿，荷池花未红。\n葛衣求体便，蔬食养心功。\n偶得因几暇，偷閒碧树丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山庄晚眺","author":"玄烨","text":"岛屿堪图画，溪桥宛自成。\n池边树影接，峰外月华生。\n众鸟巢檐稳，群獐伏地平。\n无知知德化，推扩至民情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登四面云山","author":"玄烨","text":"云梯石磴逼巃嵷，倚杖傍观众壑同。\n更上一层图远望，奈何树杂与烟笼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日山庄百花齐放","author":"玄烨","text":"咫尺雄关一线墙，景风已拂尚芬芳。\n近都爱此清凉地，逢草逢花莫不香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水画","author":"玄烨","text":"岭岫嵚崎路渺茫，画工摹写各舒长。\n云峰四起添山色，竹树重阴致夏凉。\n最爱萧疏随意笔，可称流动赏心方。\n依稀岩洞神仙住，那得閒情问草堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山中自咏","author":"玄烨","text":"一生何事不斟量，老至偷閒自可伤。\n倦体每思依石憩，俗情且喜对山忘。\n舂容无计寻方便，荏苒谁能驻景光。\n濯足沧浪清水在，企思归咏舞雩傍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居","author":"玄烨","text":"迎薰避暑驻山庄，四顾重重丘壑长。\n雨后雏莺歌密树，风前练雀舞斜廊。\n静观得趣无非景，佳兴涵虚可致凉。\n烹茗汲泉清意味，个中谁解有真香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏作回文","author":"玄烨","text":"年丰足雨和时，谷贱家家展眉。\n专意民安物阜，先为德广恩施。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"玄烨","text":"敞怀潇洒驭风仙，散虑逍遥不记年。\n名利牵情忙若辈，方知忧乐岂兼全。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早御稻","author":"玄烨","text":"紫芒半顷绿阴阴，最爱先时御稻深。\n若使炎方多广布，可能两次见秧针。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"玄烨","text":"隔溪隐隐见窗纱，几度呼童问酒家。\n尺幅林峦分远近，画工浓淡最堪誇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37457,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"挽总督赵宏燮","author":"玄烨","text":"四十馀年抚近京，旗民称善政和平。\n保全终始君恩重，奄逝悲凉众涕盈。\n不畏刁顽持法纪，久司锁钥务精明。\n官方仍在归泉壤，节钺空悬揽辔情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37458,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自笑古稀","author":"玄烨","text":"月宇启窗纱，身閒兴转赊。\n庞眉临事暗，垂老厌人哗。\n懒惰心惟静，精勤目已花。\n临池惭手涩，无复竞龙蛇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37459,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋在六月","author":"玄烨","text":"庚伏虽云尽，依然六月中。\n歊蒸临水榭，溽暑望金风。\n未变楸梧色，还舒菡萏红。\n杖藜西顾意，数问奏边功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37460,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆陜西 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"长安城阙昔曾游，黄水名山宛在眸。\n清渭东流流自在，阳关远去去何休。\n民稠地险人难化，谷贱年丰信有收。\n衰老无能再一览，缅怀西顾愈添愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37461,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆陜西 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"秦岭河西风俗淳，尚馀刚劲气难驯。\n宽严相济毋偏执，教养兼施在体仁。\n官久每闻滋反覆，吏新未晓作陶甄。\n小诗自觉乏文丽，可尽衷肠对士民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37462,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月来香","author":"玄烨","text":"月色东升候晚明，金风初到吐芳英。\n忽闻香扑纱帷近，更觉游仙梦转清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37463,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"膳酒自述","author":"玄烨","text":"盈馀休说帝王家，俭朴身先务戒奢。\n盛馔醇醲应有损，野蔬风味亦堪嘉。\n樽中旨酒无能饮，案上珍肴勿过加。\n淡泊宁心和五味，养身得正胜丹砂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37464,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"树叶扇","author":"玄烨","text":"叶绿存生气，香清却暑风。\n轻摇能夏爽，巧制见人工。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37465,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恶繁华","author":"玄烨","text":"村野无知太古风，心依先进是吾衷。\n不须问到繁华乐，愿与生民溯受中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37466,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"玄烨","text":"不逮精神老愈愁，银须鹤发更何求。\n艰难世事危心力，履薄临深岂自由。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37467,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中元日同僧语","author":"玄烨","text":"夙夜焦劳白发盈，愁肠一日几回萦。\n偷閒暂向山僧话，可扫尘缘爱憎情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37468,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜岭外水土","author":"玄烨","text":"露凝肥草净无尘，处处泉源漾碧津。\n食少事多宵旰老，暂偷閒暇养吾身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37469,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六十一年秋出哨","author":"玄烨","text":"岁岁经行处，山川照旧时。\n峰峦不改色，鬓发已如丝。\n胜地清凉适，衰年水土宜。\n非因耽逸豫，实借憩神思。\n隔岭疑围阔，闻声呼鹿随。\n归营常早歇，抚景自堪怡。\n行伍原齐备，屏藩任指麾。\n薄来厚往义，远近普恩施。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37470,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"回銮","author":"玄烨","text":"猎罢回銮塞冷时，旻天今岁落霜迟。\n围人竞带甘肥脯，田叟争收高下?。\n谷贱共知欣有食，物多须记守长规。\n西成盈野仓箱满，关内依然是所思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37471,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邑城口占","author":"彭上拔","text":"斗城淮道反弹丸，三百里余地正宽。\n岭表从今推保障，陆安自昔志奇观。\n云开叠嶂莲花翠，日映洪涛塔影寒。\n试上龙山遥放眼，海天无际好鹏抟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37472,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山烟树","author":"朱介圭","text":"树人兼树木，遗荫已千章。\n岫桂凝香远，坡松引韵长。\n蛟龙看欲起，云雾暂教藏。\n寄语今宗匠，储材有栋梁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37473,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙桥夜月","author":"朱介圭","text":"踏月长桥夜，空明豁远眸。\n虹光遥近郭，珠彩落前空。\n风漾层冰合，烟融匹练浮。\n清心同皓魄，相与印中逢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37474,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题肩诗","author":"佘圣言","text":"偶然偶然又偶然，偶然今日帝王边。\n世上既有偶然事，诸君何不效偶然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37475,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝词 山居","author":"陆丰乡土志","text":"淳风最好是山居，松作城垣竹作篱。\n投市许多山里客，出担柴炭入担重。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37476,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阙题","author":"黄殿元","text":"异族凭陵起塞边，万家灶突久无烟。\n愧他胡马三千骑，占我河山二万年。\n故国衣冠沦草莽，汉家儿女若颠连。\n着鞭空负祖生志，是日如归带血旋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37477,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答马举人","author":"黄汉宗","text":"四壁云山称卧游，酒痕衾上别杭州。\n龙津月好同消夏，雁迹风高独感秋。\n自悔不先焚笔墨，故难逆料系罗罦。\n聪明果被聪明误，为解禽言竟入囚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37478,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"百字令","author":"刘炳照","text":"重帘休卷，又斜风细雨，清明天气。\n潘鬓沈腰憔悴甚，懒向石阑重倚。\n花落花开，月圆月缺，总是愁中味。\n相思何处，美人遥隔秋水。\n休说旧约寻芳，寒侵纸帐，醉昏昏思睡。\n底事流莺啼不住，又把离魂惊起。\n柳叶含颦，桃花含笑，顿惹伤春意。\n尺书谁寄，别情千缕难寄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37479,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]